{"seq":29,"slug":"venture-capital","title":"风险投资","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 风险投资知识体系导航\n\n风险投资（Venture Capital, VC）是一种以股权形式向高成长潜力的早期企业注入资本的金融活动。它不仅是创新经济的燃料——从硅谷的半导体革命到 2026 年 AI 大模型的万亿美元融资潮，VC 始终扮演着将技术突破转化为商业现实的催化剂角色。理解 VC 的运作机制，对于程序员出身的创业者、技术型投资人、以及任何希望深度参与创新生态的从业者而言，都是一项核心素养。\n\n本 hub 聚焦于风险投资作为一种「制度化金融工具」的完整知识框架：从基金的法律架构与经济学模型，到投资决策的方法论，再到组合管理与退出机制，最终落脚于 2026 年全球 VC 行业的前沿实践。\n\n与相邻 hub 的分工边界：公司金融（corporate-finance）hub 讨论企业视角的资本结构与估值理论，是本 hub 估值方法论的上游基础；个人理财（personal-finance）hub 覆盖个人投资者可触达的公募基金与股票工具，与 VC 的另类投资属性形成对比；保险经济学（insurance-economics）hub 处理风险定价与转移机制，与 VC 的风险承担逻辑互为映照。本 hub 不重复这些内容，而是在相关节点以交叉链接指向它们。\n\n推荐学习路径因读者背景而异。对于技术背景的创业者，建议从「基金架构」起步理解投资人的激励结构，再进入「估值方法」和「条款清单」以准备融资谈判，最后阅读「AI 投资浪潮」了解当下资本市场的温度。对于有志于进入 VC 行业的从业者，建议完整按章节顺序推进：基金经济学→尽调方法论→组合构建→退出策略→前沿实践。对于纯粹的知识探索者，可以从任一感兴趣的章节切入，各篇文档均有足够的自包含性。\n\n前置知识：基础的财务报表阅读能力（推荐先读 corporate-finance 的财务分析章节）、对股权与债权融资的基本理解、以及对创业公司生命周期的感性认知。不要求有金融从业经验。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"风险投资基础架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fund-structure","title":"风险投资基金架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/foundations/fund-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fund-lifecycle","title":"基金生命周期与部署节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/foundations/fund-lifecycle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vc-ecosystem","title":"风险投资生态系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/foundations/vc-ecosystem"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"evaluation","title":"投资评估方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"due-diligence","title":"尽职调查方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/evaluation/due-diligence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"valuation-methods","title":"初创公司估值方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/evaluation/valuation-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"term-sheet","title":"条款清单与投资谈判","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/evaluation/term-sheet"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"portfolio","title":"投资组合与退出管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/portfolio","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"portfolio-construction","title":"投资组合构建策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/portfolio/portfolio-construction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"post-investment","title":"投后管理与增值服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/portfolio/post-investment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"exit-strategies","title":"退出策略与回报实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/portfolio/exit-strategies"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"前沿实践与行业变局","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-investment-wave","title":"AI 投资浪潮与资本重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/practice/ai-investment-wave"},{"seq":2,"slug":"china-vc-globalization","title":"中国风险投资的国资化与全球化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/practice/china-vc-globalization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spv-secondary-market","title":"SPV 架构与二级市场交易","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/venture-capital/practice/spv-secondary-market"}]}]}